WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Kill him and go walk the golden river

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,960
It may directly change everything now

3
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,520
a living reborn

4
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:07,840
It is far more valuable than a golden river with unknown rules.

5
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:09,720
I won't test your number of rebirths

6
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:11,120
I won’t marry your Jin He either

7
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:13,000
But don’t tell others about this ability yet.

8
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,320
Once the news that can change time spreads,

9
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,760
Both humanity and loss will be watching you

10
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:17,920
why do you want to believe me

11
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,760
I don't completely believe you

12
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:22,560
It's just that cooperation is more valuable than testing each other

13
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:23,800
Arrived in Oligar

14
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:31,700
After you read the rules, you decide whether to stay or not.

15
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:37,690
Welcome the king back

16
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:40,450
It was you who broke into human dwellings without authorization and caused trouble for the king.
